    "string": "depict this in a strong flatdeep style, zengostyle. STYLIZED SEMIREALISM.\n\nEmphasize layered depth effect.\n\nBold edge highlight creating strong edge separation.\n\nUse a polychromatic palette with rich tonal variations and an expanded color spectrum. Deep, distinct color value across all elements with high color saturation in the distance. \n\n\nUse extremely varied color palette with a broad color gamut. Colors are natural but enhanced to pop.\nReplce monochromatics. Replace monotone. Replace browns.\n\nUse a perfectly balanced histogram.\nEnsure lighting is consistent. Keep the ground detail simple.\nRemove the excessive ground noise.\nMake the ground detail more consistent and coherent. Replace noisy textures and patterns with subtler duotone patterns.\n\nExaggerated layered depth effect. stepped depth details. Crisp cutout edges. \n\nbeautifully rendered forms. sculpted shadows emphasizing depth.\nflat 2d figures on a 3d volumetric plane. stark separation of layers.\nEmphasize depth effect. crisp layered comic art.\n\nRender elements receding with softened level of detail based on distance from the focal plane. \n\n fine lineart throughout. softer lines in the distance.\n\nthe distant background has the softest outlines.\n\nRemove flyaways and loose strands."
   },
